 "statement": {
  "status": "present",
  "value": "Variant 2 plus users. addUser(id,capacity) fails if the user exists. addFileBy(user,name,size) stores a file owned by the user if the user exists, the name is free and used+size <= capacity; it returns remaining capacity, otherwise -1. Files from addFile belong to an unlimited admin owner. copyFile charges the source owner and fails if it would exceed that owner's capacity. mergeUser(a,b) (a != b, both exist) moves b's files and capacity to a, deletes b and returns a's remaining capacity, else -1.",
  "provenance": [
   {
    "repository": "gamma",
